        "fullReportHtml": "<div class=\"space-y-6 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed\">\n  <div class=\"bg-slate-50/80 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-5 md:p-6 shadow-xs\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-4\">\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 border border-sky-200\">深度学习计算机视觉</span>\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-200\">卷积注意力机制 (CNN + Attention)</span>\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-200\">轻量化模型设计</span>\n    </div>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2\">多任务课题规划与研究目标</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 mb-4\">高二（5）班须天人同学针对人脸图像多维属性表征展开系统研究，设立了<strong>任务一（性别二分类）</strong>与<strong>任务二（10位个体人脸多分类识别）</strong>两大实战方向。研究不仅横向评测了经典工业模型（AlexNet、ResNet-18/50、EfficientNet-B0）在不同优化器下的收敛动力学，更自主设计了一款参数量仅为 AlexNet 四十分之一的轻量级注意力神经网络。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bg-slate-50/80 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-5 md:p-6 shadow-xs\">\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-600\"></span>\n      自主模型架构设计 (OurModel：1.5M 参数量)\n    </h3>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs mb-3\">\n      <div class=\"bg-white p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs\">\n        <div class=\"text-sky-700 font-bold mb-1\">特征提取器（4 个渐进卷积块）</div>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-600\">每个块标准级联 <code>Conv2d &rarr; BatchNorm2d &rarr; ReLU &rarr; MaxPool2d &rarr; Dropout</code>，并在深层引入通道-空间双域注意力掩模，精准聚焦五官关键面貌特征。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-white p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs\">\n        <div class=\"text-emerald-700 font-bold mb-1\">精简双层分类器</div>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-600\">特征图展平后接入两层全连接线性层，配合动态学习率调度器（Learning Rate Scheduler），彻底规避传统巨型全连接层带来的过拟合与显存爆炸。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bg-slate-50/80 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-5 md:p-6 shadow-xs\">\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-600\"></span>\n      实验发现与模型泛化洞察\n    </h3>\n    <ul class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-2 list-disc pl-4\">\n      <li><strong>优化器对比</strong>：在相同学习率下，收敛稳定性表现为 <code>AdamW &gt; Adam &gt; SGD</code>，带有权重衰减正则项的 AdamW 在微调阶段表现更佳。</li>\n      <li><strong>深度与任务匹配悖论</strong>：在简单任务与中等规模数据集上，ResNet-50 准确率反而显著低于轻量型的 ResNet-18。证明网络并非越深越好，盲目堆砌参数极易在小数据集上发生严重过拟合。</li>\n      <li><strong>高质量数据清洗决定上限</strong>：通过爬虫爬取 3,000 余张人脸图片后，人工执行严格的遮挡、阴阳脸与模糊清洗，使得验证集 F1-Score 提升了 12 个百分点。</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>"
