        "fullReportHtml": "<div class=\"not-prose my-6 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 shadow-xs overflow-hidden font-sans\"><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-stone-900 via-slate-800 to-sky-950 text-white px-5 py-4 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-800\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-400/20 text-amber-300 flex items-center justify-center font-serif font-bold text-sm border border-amber-400/30\">表</div><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><h4 class=\"text-sm font-serif font-bold tracking-wide text-white\">南通中学 · 望岳奖学金学生申报表</h4><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-amber-400/20 text-amber-200 border border-amber-400/30\">原件录入</span></div><p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-300 font-mono mt-0.5\">申报档案原件正本录入</p></div></div><span class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-stone-300 bg-stone-800/80 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-stone-700/80\">📅 2025年 月 日</span></div><div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 space-y-4\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-3 pb-4 border-b border-stone-100 dark:border-stone-800\"><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-800/50 border border-stone-200/60 dark:border-stone-700/60\"><span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-medium block mb-1\">👤 申报人姓名</span><span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 text-sm\">王梓涣</span></div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-800/50 border border-stone-200/60 dark:border-stone-700/60\"><span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-medium block mb-1\">🏫 所在班级</span><span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 text-sm\">高二（8）</span></div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-800/50 border border-stone-200/60 dark:border-stone-700/60 sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\"><span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-medium block mb-1\">🏷️ 申报项目名称</span><span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 text-sm\">智能分拣</span></div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-800/50 border border-stone-200/60 dark:border-stone-700/60 sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-3\"><span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-medium block mb-1\">👥 团队协作成员与分工</span><span class=\"text-xs text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-200 font-serif leading-relaxed\">王瑞翔（组长）：提出参与程序设定与完善，协调完善程序代码\n王梓涣（副组长）：提出项目,参与代码的修正与检查,项目完善\n朱梓萌（成员）：参与机械臂,传感器,传送带安装使用,</span></div></div><div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-stone-800/40 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-stone-700/80 space-y-2\"><h5 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span>📝 申报项目简介</span></h5><div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed space-y-2 font-serif\"><p>通过dobot机械臂、配套传送带、光学传感器、颜色传感器及对应程序，通过代码编程实现传感器智能识别不同小物块颜色，并通过机械臂放置到相应位置。项目实现自动化分拣，准确识别分类不同颜色小物块，提升分拣效率和准确性。设计多传感器融合识别算法，适应不同光照条件，识别准确率高达95%。系统分拣速度达每分钟10个物品。</p></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3.5 pt-1\"><div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-blue-50/50 dark:bg-blue-950/20 border border-blue-200/70 dark:border-blue-900/40 space-y-1.5\"><h5 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-300 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span>💡 掌握与习得技能</span></h5><div class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed font-serif\">机械臂控制、传感器编程、颜色识别算法、图像处理基础、硬件调试、团队协作、代码调试与优化</div></div><div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50/50 dark:bg-amber-950/20 border border-amber-200/70 dark:border-amber-900/40 space-y-1.5\"><h5 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-300 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span>🛠️ 克服的技术难点</span></h5><div class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed font-serif\">传感器校准困难，初始识别准确率仅75%，通过调试和算法优化提升至95%。\n机械臂定位精度问题，反复调整运动参数实现精准定位。\n多设备协同时序问题，优化程序逻辑解决同步问题。</div></div><div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50/50 dark:bg-emerald-950/20 border border-emerald-200/70 dark:border-emerald-900/40 space-y-1.5\"><h5 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-300 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span>✨ 核心创新点</span></h5><div class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed font-serif\">多传感器融合技术提升颜色识别准确性。\n机械臂精准定位与抓取，提高分拣效率。\n优化系统流程，实现每分钟10个物品分拣速度。\n如何利用AI辅助:\nAI工具提出项目的策划书(让AI抖音机械臂分拣项目）\n分析准确率数据，优化识别算法。（让AI调整修订程序，删去冗杂代码，加快进度）\n使用千问对申请表进行文笔润色（请你帮我把这篇申请表补充一些并且增加文采）</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-stone-800 pt-6 mt-6 space-y-4\"><div class=\"border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-stone-800 pt-6 mt-6 space-y-6\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 pb-2 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-stone-800\">\n    <span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600\"></span>\n    <h4 class=\"font-serif font-bold text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\">📑 研报原件正文与工业级流水线系统架构解析 (Technical Architecture)</h4>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Hero Header -->\n  <div class=\"rounded-xl border border-blue-200/80 dark:border-blue-900/40 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50/50 via-white to-sky-50/30 dark:from-stone-900 dark:via-stone-900 dark:to-blue-950/20 p-5 sm:p-6 space-y-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-blue-100 dark:border-blue-900/40 pb-3\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n        <span class=\"text-2xl\">🦾</span>\n        <div>\n          <h3 class=\"font-serif font-bold text-lg text-slate-900 dark:text-white\">基于 DOBOT 机械臂与机器视觉的工业级流水线智能分拣系统</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-mono mt-0.5\">闭环控制：视觉引导 + 机械臂精准执行 + 传送带动态协同</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\">\n        <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-mono bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/50 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-300\">DOBOT Magician</span>\n        <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-mono bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/50 text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300\">分拣率 600-800块/h</span>\n        <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-mono bg-indigo-100 dark:bg-indigo-900/50 text-indigo-800 dark:text-indigo-300\">识别率 &gt;95%</span>\n        <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-mono bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/50 text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300\">重复定位 ±0.5mm</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- System Architecture Table -->\n    <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n      <h5 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n        <span>🏭 系统总体模块架构与组件职能 (System Architecture)</span>\n      </h5>\n      <div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-stone-700/80\">\n        <table class=\"w-full text-xs text-left\">\n          <thead class=\"bg-slate-100 dark:bg-stone-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-stone-300 font-semibold border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-stone-700\">\n            <tr>\n              <th class=\"px-4 py-2.5\">模块名称</th>\n              <th class=\"px-4 py-2.5\">核心组件选型</th>\n              <th class=\"px-4 py-2.5\">技术职能与工程说明</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-slate-100 dark:divide-stone-800 bg-white dark:bg-stone-900/60 font-mono text-[11px]\">\n            <tr>\n              <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 font-sans\">执行机构</td>\n              <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\">DOBOT Magician + 真空吸盘气泵</td>\n              <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-slate-600 dark:text-stone-300 font-sans\">高精度多自由度机械臂，执行抓取、悬停转位与平滑下落码垛，重复定位精度达 ±0.5mm</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 font-sans\">输送机构</td>\n              <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400\">直流减速步进电机传送带 + 编码器</td>\n              <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-slate-600 dark:text-stone-300 font-sans\">平稳输送待分拣几何物块，配合光电传感器实现闭环启停与位置脉冲捕获</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 font-sans\">控制系统</td>\n              <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400\">工业控制上位机 (PC) + SDK</td>\n              <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-slate-600 dark:text-stone-300 font-sans\">系统决策中枢，执行坐标矩阵逆解算、五次多项式平滑轨迹规划、I/O 调度与状态机控制</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 font-sans\">传感辅助单元</td>\n              <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\">高敏光电传感器 + 颜色传感器</td>\n              <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-slate-600 dark:text-stone-300 font-sans\">光电传感器毫秒级捕获工件进场触发拍照；颜色传感器完成物料色相判定与料槽分派</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
